      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KIA ORA LASS (8) caught the eye on debut when well supported and charged out of the boxes with a fast early sectional, going on to clock 29.59 in a 12 length win at this track over 515m. Exciting prospect and rates the one to beat again. BULL ROSE (2) is a 12 start maiden who has placed five times, the latest finishing in the minor money again when second at this track. Has finished in the money the last three starts. Overdue and expected to feature again. BAROOGA PRINCE (1) took the sit on the lead from an outside box but levelled up and drew clear to score (29.71) at this track in a Maiden H over 515m. One of the leading chances again. MINDS EYE (6) did a good job to finish second last time out over 515m at this track (30.13) in a Maiden H, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
